.TH AEGISROUTE-AGENT 1 "October 2026" "AegisRoute 3.1.0" "Advaitik Intelligence"
.SH NAME
aegisroute-agent \- serve an atomically updated AegisRoute report to a remote collector
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aegisroute-agent
.BI --report " FILE"
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The agent is a deliberately read-only HTTP service. It serves a JSON report that
was created separately by AegisRoute. HTTP requests cannot select a target or
start a probe. Bind to loopback and place it behind an authenticated TLS reverse
proxy for remote use.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --report " FILE"
Existing AegisRoute JSON report to serve. Required.
.TP
.BI --listen " ADDRESS"
Listen address. Default: 127.0.0.1.
.TP
.BI --port " PORT"
TCP port. Default: 8787.
.TP
.BI --token " TOKEN"
Require an Authorization: Bearer header. Prefer AEGISROUTE_AGENT_TOKEN so the
secret does not enter command history.
.TP
.BI --signing-key " SECRET"
HMAC-SHA256 key used to sign successful responses. Prefer
.B AEGISROUTE_AGENT_SIGNING_KEY
to avoid shell history.
.TP
.BI --allowed-cidr " CIDR"
Permit serving only reports whose destination is within this CIDR. Repeatable.
.TP
.BI --requests-per-minute " N"
Per-client request ceiling. Default: 30.
.TP
.BI --tls-cert " FILE"
and
.BI --tls-key " FILE"
Enable server TLS. A non-loopback listen address is rejected unless TLS is set.
.TP
.BI --tls-ca " FILE"
Trust this client CA and require client certificates: mutual TLS.
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Show help.
.SH ENDPOINTS
.TP
.B /health
Returns a small status document after authentication.
.TP
.B /report
Returns the current JSON report with no-store and nosniff response headers.
.SH SECURITY
The built-in server must not be exposed to an untrusted network without TLS.
Use a long random token, response signing, destination policy, firewall rules,
and a dedicated unprivileged service account. Supplying a client CA enables mTLS.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AEGISROUTE_AGENT_TOKEN
Default bearer token.
.TP
.B AEGISROUTE_AGENT_SIGNING_KEY
Default response-signing key.
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
aegisroute example.com --format json -o /var/lib/aegisroute/latest.json
AEGISROUTE_AGENT_TOKEN=secret aegisroute-agent \
  --report /var/lib/aegisroute/latest.json
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aegisroute (1)
